;; web-nodes.edn — the web plane's node registry (ADR-260929). Operator config.
;;
;; :host is an ssh name (fleet.edn's Tailscale MagicDNS names). :zone is the
;; operator's DECLARATION of where the node's traffic exits to the internet;
;; dual-zone verification (murakumo.web.verify) refuses to run unless the
;; requested replicas sit in DISTINCT zones. Every fleet node today shares one
;; public egress address, so they are all honestly "jp" and verification cannot
;; pass. A node with a different egress (a VPS or cloud function in another
;; region running the same bundle) is what adds a zone — do not relabel a node
;; to satisfy the check.
;;
;; No secrets belong here.
{:nodes [{:host "benjamin" :zone "jp"}
         {:host "gad" :zone "jp"}]}
